# Files NOT to upload when deploying with the Vercel CLI.
#
# With the serverless token endpoint (api/onemap-token.js), credentials live in
# Vercel Environment Variables (ONEMAP_EMAIL / ONEMAP_PASSWORD) — NOT in any
# uploaded file. So, unlike the old static-only setup, we deliberately DO NOT
# ship js/config.js or any .env file. Nothing secret ends up in the client
# bundle or the deployment.
#
# If you are NOT using the serverless function and instead rely on a token in
# js/config.js, remove the "js/config.js" line below so the CLI uploads it.

.git
node_modules
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode
.idea

# Secrets — keep these out of the deployment
js/config.js
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
